    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 355,
        "text": "Hi, everyone. Thanks for coming to the student technology committee meeting. I'm Maya, and I run the committee this term. We're here to talk about the new campus shuttle app. The pilot starts next Monday, and we need to decide what to recommend to the university. Let's start with the data from last month's survey. Ben, can you give us the numbers?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "1e7de1c0a5a07750e053d8373889d9a5746ab7eaf6c1321e975cbd378c688208",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 362,
        "sourceEnd": 605,
        "text": "Sure. We asked 400 students about the old shuttle system. Only 28 percent said they were satisfied with the current app. That's a big problem. But when we asked about the new app, 65 percent said they would probably use it. That's a huge jump.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "ad2e33e4de77faaf7bdf90edf7004a0b0c55703281e0076b7e9e276831ed4ab4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 613,
        "sourceEnd": 722,
        "text": "Wait, Ben, let me check that. You said 65 percent would probably use it? I thought the number was 56 percent.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "958118a657c6ba9f1739e221cf1133b335662cb895554642467985c8ffcb7f34",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 729,
        "sourceEnd": 920,
        "text": "Oh, you're right. Sorry, I mixed up two surveys. The 65 percent was for the library app. For the shuttle app, it's 56 percent. So, 56 percent said they would probably use the new shuttle app.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "4e8f2b88cce87c62e7930b996f2399123e0d604d2de711674b70a99e0e7f9b87",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 928,
        "sourceEnd": 1169,
        "text": "Thanks for correcting that. Fifty-six is twice twenty-eight, but that doesn't mean satisfaction has doubled. One answer reports current satisfaction; the other predicts possible use. We must keep those measures separate. What about the cost?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "0f761c66c57490e9e8bda9a910aa57c11264e119474571480895ebe2250db637",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1176,
        "sourceEnd": 1474,
        "text": "The new app costs $12,000 to develop. The old app costs $8,000 a year to maintain. The new app will cost $5,000 a year to maintain. So, in the first year, the total cost is $17,000. After that, it's $5,000 a year. The old app is $8,000 every year. So, the new app saves money after about two years.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "fb206178c1836ee4d8f6c93a0bcbeeea776f5b2fb3e72f9584736a569747e71b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1482,
        "sourceEnd": 1730,
        "text": "Hold on. The yearly maintenance saving is only three thousand dollars. It takes four years to recover the twelve-thousand-dollar development cost. At the end of year four, each option totals thirty-two thousand, assuming these costs stay unchanged.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "32b4c6e6e3dd19dd73b9150bae88055ee6a8e2a3421d3fe30c5bcaa2c1c9e7a1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1737,
        "sourceEnd": 1906,
        "text": "You're right. Lower annual maintenance is not the same as a lower total cost immediately. From year five, the new app would be cheaper overall, unless extra costs arose.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "0334b2b4912bb3bd97cc114ee13d5525eb4db5eae144a58f733b3f02b791b5b6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1914,
        "sourceEnd": 2137,
        "text": "Now, let's talk about the hidden assumptions. Some students assume the new app will work everywhere on campus. But the pilot only covers the main campus. The north campus is not included yet. That's an important limitation.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "c5ac010b3630f21da951c94ee8572bd9e7aa8ecfc84a49c694af8d4bd2a968d9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 2144,
        "sourceEnd": 2315,
        "text": "Right. Also, some people think the app will show real-time bus locations. But in the pilot, it only shows scheduled times. Real-time tracking comes later, maybe next year.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "fc30040ffe44e9e6c67d7ef8d097f45af0ca1b045c99055c381673e179e88d6e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2323,
        "sourceEnd": 2513,
        "text": "So, we need to be careful about what we promise. The survey shows interest, but the pilot is limited. Let's recommend the pilot, but with clear information about these limits. Any questions?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "59e2bee33da47ce0e2e35b2362a8c9221fda07b345395e510736cadb49fb669e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 2520,
        "sourceEnd": 2758,
        "text": "One more thing. The survey also asked about the old app's problems. The top problem was that it often crashed. 45 percent of students said it crashed at least once a week. The new app is designed to crash less, but we don't have data yet.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "29debe7b2ada7ee48359727e583bf3511a8370e9dfc0e326838818f53216e43b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2766,
        "sourceEnd": 2973,
        "text": "During the pilot, let's record failures per one hundred attempted checks, not just total complaints. If twice as many people try the app, the number of complaints could rise even when the failure rate falls.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "a8424098b248e6dbfa47412e846ce3494a4d00e92afb9fe5b0226c4576668369",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 2980,
        "sourceEnd": 3150,
        "text": "And we should compare the same routes and times of day. Otherwise a quieter service could make the app seem more reliable. We can report the limits alongside the results.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "a71e543249a8437c9725247397e4a1d3436def0ae3a457edafea2f9fba9c1578",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 3158,
        "sourceEnd": 3347,
        "text": "Okay. So, our recommendation: support the pilot, but tell students about the limited coverage and the scheduled times only. And we should collect data during the pilot. Does everyone agree?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "825c6a4d9a25421db387fc15efa35410d74f287a9ca1bdd49297d02bcb6446b4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 3354,
        "sourceEnd": 3367,
        "text": "Yes, I agree.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "7f716ce9ebefbf8e2b71a1551ec8f8f701821dbf0946a2c28f766c8c8a93c898",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 3375,
        "sourceEnd": 3461,
        "text": "Great. Let's meet again in two weeks to review the first pilot data. Thanks, everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7b03902b63b91f9c66731ef3fdbba1973bfef07461ce185a7c7d343ad22bb46a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.7
      }
    ]
  },
